1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From the updated 3rd edition, Volume 3, of the Unbroken Chain, page 552:
2 CONT
2 CONT G12.1 R' Haim Solomon ''Zeimler'' Rabinowitz/Rabinovitch, ABD Zeimel (Zeimelis, Zeimys)
2 CONT
2 CONT He is the son of G11.2 Aryey Leib Katzenellenbogen, ABD Brest-Litovsk, died 1837.
2 CONT
2 CONT _________________________________________________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT listed as R. Haim Solomon Zimler, A.B.D. Zeimel in The Unbroken Chain (page 647, Chapter VIII, Branch C) However, Reb Shlomo had a son named Chaim of Krekenava
2 CONT
2 CONT Reb Shlomo was the rabbi in Zeimelis (Zheimel) from 1824 to his death in 1864.
2 CONT
2 CONT Reb Shlomo was apparently considered a 'Wonder rabbi' who could cure the sick with his prayers. He had a herb garden and was knowledgable on heir medicinal properties, administering herbs with prayers.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources that mention Reb Shlomo specifically by that name include:
2 CONT
2 CONT "''Zheimel History''", available at [http://kehilalinks.jewishgen.org/zeimelis/yosefros.htm] (listing R. Shlomo as rabbi from 1824-1864, with Benjamin-Dober Diamand succeeding him, apparently until 1883 when Rabbi Shalom Elchanan 
2 CONC Jaffe replaced Benjamin.
2 CONT
2 CONT "''Jewish Cities, Towns and Villages in Lithuania until 1918 (Lithuania) Yidishe shtet, shtetlekh un dorfishe yishuvim in Lite: biz 1918: historish-biografishe skitse''s", page 173 available at http://www.hebrewbooks.org/pagefeed/
2 CONC hebrewbooks_org_46565_182.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT  רבנים. — הגאון המקובל ר׳
2 CONT  שלמה, פץ 1824 ביז 1864 ,ווען ניפטר
2 CONT  געווארן. געלעבט אין גרוים דחקות. זיין
2 CONT  אייניקל ר׳ משה־יהודה ראבינאוויטש,
2 CONT  מחבר פון מספד גדול וכבד אויפן זיידן.
2 CONT  ר׳ בנימין בר׳ דוב דימאנד, פון
2 CONT  1864 ,שפעטער אב״ד פאסוואל און
2 CONT  סימפעראפאל. זי_ץ פאטער אב״ד טאווריק,
2 CONT  זשידיק.
2 CONT
2 CONT (stating Reb Shlomo was in Zeimelis from 1824 to 1864 and that he had a son Benjamin Dober Diamond and a grandson Moshe Yehuda Rabinowitz)
2 CONT
2 CONT ''מספד גדול וכבד מאוד'', available at [http://www.hebrewbooks.org/19477[ ]]Message board post #2 at [https://translate.google.com/translate?hl=en&sl=iw&u=http://forum.otzar.org/forums/viewtopic.php%3Ft%3D9260&prev=search] notes Mo
2 CONC she Yehuda Rabinowitz was son of Isaac and  grandson of R. Shlomo from Zeimel)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT
