2 CONT "R. Meshullam Zalman Ashkenazi, A.B.D. Pamorzany (Pomarin), died as a young man at the age of twenty-four.   He married Reizel, his niece, daughter of R. Aryeh Lieb Auerbach, A.B.D. Stanislaw."
