1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Rabbi [Yekhiel Mikhel] Burstein was born in 1872. On his father's side, he was the grandson of the late righteous Gaon Rabbi Yosef, and on his mother's side, he was the grandson of the late Gaon Leibush from Stani
2 CONC slav, the uncle of Meir Margaliot, who wrote “Meir Netivim”."  Yednitz Memorial Book: p376: https://www.jewishgen.org/yizkor/yedintsy/yed0353.html#Page375
2 CONT
2 CONT PLEASE NOTE: THERE ARE SEVERAL MORE GENERATIONS BETWEEN THE MOTHER OF R' Yekhiel Mikhel Burstein (b 1872) and R' Aryeh Leyb Auerbach (d 1749) only one generation is shown here.
