2 CONT Prominent members of the Horowitz family, in lude Samuel Horowitz who was born in Lemberg (today's Lvov) in 1841 in whose city she was retailer and landowner. He was also president of the Israeli Cultural Society ("Israelitischen 
2 CONC Cultusgemeinde") in Lemberg. Samuel Horowitz was ennoblecido by the Austrian emperor in Vienna in 1894 granting to it him the shield of arms that is described down.
2 CONT
2 CONT More info: [http://www.jewishgen.org/ The JewishGen] Ukraine Database // HOROWITZ records from Lwow Wojewodztwa
2 CONT --------------------
