1 NOTE {geni:about_me} R' Aryeh Judah Leib Teomim was born in Lissa, Posen [now Leszno, Poland] about 1756, the son of R' Samuel Teomim (c1729-1794), later A.B.D. Lobsens.  He was Av Beit Din (A.B.D.) -- chief rabbinical judge, chairman 
2 CONC of the court -- in his native Lissa for many years before serving at Loschitz [Lostice], Moravia (c1786-1788).  For the last few years of his life, from late 1788 until his death in 1794, he was A.B.D. at Holesov, Moravia.  Accord
2 CONC ing to his biography, he died at Holesov on 16 Mar 1794, although no death entry for him can be found in Holesov Jewish records.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was buried at Loschitz [Lostice] on 18 Mar 1794.  His gravestone bears the name "Jehuda Taomim". It should be noted that “The History of the Jews in Lissa” says he was the son of R’ Joseph, but this is an error.  His father ins
2 CONC tead was R' Samuel, son of R' Joseph.
2 CONT
2 CONT The only discernible date on his gravestone – 10 Tevet 5537 [20 Dec 1776] – was not his death date, but was either the date he became a rabbi or the date of his marriage. However, given the current deteriorated state of his marker
2 CONC , it is also possible that the date was incorrectly captured.
2 CONT
2 CONT In Holesov, he is referred to as "Juda Lissa", "R. Juda Lisser", "Rabbi Juda Lob Teomim", and by his civil name of "Lobl Zwillinger" [Zwillinger and Teomim both mean “twins”].  He is listed as a notable rabbi in the history of Hol
2 CONC esov.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Hebrew writing on his gravestone has been interpreted as follows:  "... And the righteous went this way of Life.  He sat in the stalls of Jacob day and night, as a mighty lion, taught and judged the art of judgment in the mids
2 CONC t of his flock, and did [cedakot?] and carefully guarded the Treasure. .. Even in the depths of his heart he confessed the truth and the teachings of the Truth (he kept) in public and in private, and thus went in perfect perfectio
2 CONC n to judge his people - this then be Judah .."
2 CONT
2 CONT יצא הצדיק sprawa דרך החיים פנ יושב אוהל יום וליל גבר כארי יהי הורה ודן השכיה מדון מתוך הע * ופועל צדק וחזק נזר לו נאה שבח ותודה דובר אמת בלבו תורת אמת בנגלה ובע * הלך בתומו עשות משפט עמו וזאת ליהו * הה הרב מאור הגליל חכם הכולל המה
2 CONC ו יהודה תאומים נתבקש לישיבה של מעלה ליל ה י טבת תקלז
