1 NOTE {geni:about_me} MARKUS [MEIR] ZWILLINGER, aka “MARKUS POLLAK”, aka “MEIR TEOMIM”, b. c1767 [fl. 1761-1780], son of Juda Lobl Teomim-Zwillinger-Pollak (1731-1796) and his wife Tscharna (1735-1807). He lived first in Holesov, then m
2 CONC oved to Vorosvar, Hungary in the 1790s. He remained there until 1831 when he moved to Pest in 1837. He remained there until his death on 17 Oct 1859. His age at death is given as 98, but he was likely only 92 at the time.
2 CONT
2 CONT Vorosvar, 1821-1822: ZWILLINGER, Marcus, with wife, one son, four daughters
2 CONT
2 CONT Pest, 1833: #1113 – ZWILLINGER, Marcus, age 54 yrs., b. Veresvar; wife Francisca, age 46 yrs., b. Brunn; dau Anna, age ¾ yrs., b. Pesth; dau Magdalena, age 18 yrs., b. Veresvar; and maid.
2 CONT
2 CONT Pest, 1836: #702 – ZWILLINGER, Marc., age 60 yrs., b. Vorosvar; wife Fany, age 41 yrs., b. Brunn; dau Cathi, age 19 yrs., b. Pest; dau Anna, age 4 yrs., b. Pest; plus servant, Marie D----, age 13, b. Szambek
2 CONT
2 CONT Pest, 1840: ZWILLINGER, Marcus, age 60 yrs., b. Vorosvar; wife Fani, age 50 yrs., b. Vorosvar; and dau Anna, age 8 yrs., b. Pest
2 CONT
2 CONT Pest, 1846: #1643 – ZWILLINGER, Mark, age 73 yrs., b. Vorosvar; wife Fani, age 62 yrs., b. Vorosvar; and dau Anna, age 13 yrs., b. Pest
2 CONT
2 CONT He m. 1st, Reizl, b. c1770. She was deceased by 1795.
2 CONT
2 CONT He m. 2nd, in Holesov, 18 Jul 1795, Sara, b. Holesov, 1776. The marriage record refers to him as “Markus Pollak, age 28, widower”. She d. in Vorosvar, c1800.
2 CONT
2 CONT He m. 3rd, in Vorosvar, c1802, Regina [Rebeka] [Rivka], b. c1780. She d. in Vorosvar, c1830.
2 CONT
2 CONT He m. 4th, in Vorosvar, c1831, Johanna [Franciska] [“Fani”], b. Brno, 1788 [fl. 1784-1795]. She d. in Pest, 16 Oct 1866, age 78 yrs.
