1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Barbara (aka Brauna), wife of R' Markus [Meir] Teomim-Zwillinger, was born in Lissa, c1727, and died in household #8, Holesov, on 9 July 1800, "age 76" [actually age about 73].  She was the daughter of one R' Morde
2 CONC chai of Lissa [surname unknown].
2 CONT
2 CONT She was Frau Barbara Zwillinger[in], involved in a legal transaction in Holesov, 8 Jan 1786.  Following her husband's death, she remained in House No. 8, sharing it with her son Samuel and his family.
