1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jonas Teomim-Zwillinger was twin to his brother Salomon.  He was born in Lissa in 1767 and came to Holesov, Moravia with his parents, c1777.  He later moved to Mahr. Weisskirchen, Moravia (now Hranice, CZ) where he
2 CONC  resided in House No. 9 and was Familiant #70.  He was married in Mahr. Weisskirchen, 18 Jun 1792, to Anna Deutsch, age 20.  Witnesses were his father, “M. Zwillinger”, and her father, Aron Deutsch.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonas Zwillinger died in Mahr. Weisskirchen on 20 Jun 1837, age 70.
