2 CONT
2 CONT     * Abraham Meshulam ZALMAN ASHKENAZI
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Miriam ASHKENAZI married Arie LEIB (LOENSTEIN) (Av Beit Din) (b. 1690, d. 1755) 
