2 CONT He {Aryeh Leib Auerbach} had a son Rabbi David Tzvi and daughters: Reizel the wife of Rabbi Meshullam Zalmen Ashkenazy ABD Pomeran, and when he died at the age of 25 she married Rabbi Tsvi Hersh Margolis ABD Lublin (and some say R
