1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Benjamin Rabinowitz was a rabbi in Joniskis, Lithuania where he raised two sons with his wife Gittel Dvora.
2 CONT
2 CONT At the outset of World War I, he was living in Gruzd with his daughter-in-law Masha Rabinowitz and his 4 grandchildren (his son Boris had left for the United States).  At some point during the exile of Jews from the Siauliai area,
2 CONC  Benjamin Rabinowitz died in Vitebsk.
