1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT In fact, according to the found documents, R’ Zeev Wolf Kohn had two different daughters :
2 CONT - №1) Gentla/ Hendla   -born in 1815 on the 5th of January - presumed wife of Noach (Nevach) Pines died at age of 6 months the same year she was born (see death certificate attached to her profile) 
2 CONT - №2) Hinda - born in 1819 on the 5th of August - wife of Abraham Rappaport (married in Tomaszow Lubelski in 1836 view the marriage record from Tomaszow attached to her profile) that is mostly probably had two husbands. The marria
2 CONC ge certificate of Golda Pines from 1870 says that her mother was HINDA PINES and not Gendla. 
2 CONT That’s why I rearranged the tree according to the information found. 
