2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT source: see: https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000028065879753&photo_id=6000000187933209928&position=0 : mentioned on line 1-2 Yosef of Opoczna
2 CONT
2 CONT There is much confusion regarding the father and mother. Otser HaRabanim, without mentioning who is his father, says he is the grandson of 'Megenei Shlomo' (# 7570: https://www.geni.com/people/R-Yehoshua-Charif-of-Krakow-Meginei-S
2 CONC hlomo/6000000006709488424), which is possible chronologically: not explained in Otser how this occurred; could https://www.geni.com/people/Chaim-XXXXX/6000000216676269852 instead be https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Chaim-Charif/6
2 CONC 000000017633696658, or one of Meginei Shlomo's other sons? The problem with that is that other sources say his father is a Chaim b. Shmuel. This is further complicated by another source (https://www.geni.com/photo/view?photo_id=60
2 CONC 00000210036028825) explaining that there are two Chaim b Shmuels (both related by marriage to Binyamin Vulf Heilprin). One is the Chaim b. Shmuel who married an unnamed daughter of Binyamin Vulf Heilprin, and the other is a Chaim 
2 CONC b. Shmuel who married Hadassah b. Naphtali Hirsch b. Binyamin Vulf Heilprin; so the question becomes is it more likely that the daughter or the granddaughter of Binyamin Vulf Heilprin (he was bca 1620-30) is the mother of https://
2 CONC www.geni.com/people/R-Abraham-Reb-Haims-of-Lublin/6000000003370387991, who was born ca 1655-65 (I have not seen a source on either his DOB or his DOD). Since either maternal option is theoretically possible it is a guess at the mo
2 CONC ment to show that Reb Haims is the son of the Chaim b Shmuel who is the one who married a daughter of Binyamin Vulf Heilprin, who is one generation earlier than the granddaughter Hadassah. This is the view being presented here on 
2 CONC GENI, but the matter requires further confirmation and may be amended in future. (14-27 MAR 2025)
2 CONT
2 CONT     *************************
2 CONT https://tablet.otzar.org/#/b/642223/p/-1/t/1715448038958/fs/EZ6gPRPK6bvD30dp30ad7BmiQTTSiGl5dcM6kPZLBuIX/start/129/end/138/c
2 CONT ----
