2 CONT "The new president [of Council of Four Lands], Abraham, son of Hayim, was the second member of the
2 CONT Halperin family to hold the office. He was well connected to the Jewish political elite through his family ties: his father, Hayim, was a stepson of Abraham Isserles; and his son, Jacob Hayim, married Hayah, daughter of Abraham Is
2 CONC aac Fortis. Abraham himself had represented Lublin in the council since 1724." https://muse.jhu.edu/article/846614 (p. 132)
2 CONT
