1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Referenced at:  http://www.hebrewbooks.org/pdfpager.aspx?req=21569&pgnum=509 , as the wife of Aryeh Leib "der Oycher" "The Tall" ABD of Vienna, died and buried in Cracow, Poland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Another reference quotes her as the wife of a different Arieh LEIB of Cracow, Gd.son of the Maharal of Prage, son of Tzvi Hirsch Sabatka and Tilla Loew (daughter of the Maharal). Also died in Cracow, Poland and buried there.
2 CONT
2 CONT Was she the wife of both? No reference of her having been married twice.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT At http://www.loebtree.com/tilla.html#deb there is info on a certain Jute Fishel,  spouse of Rav Arie Leib from Krakow; it coincides with our sefer ichus, where Aryeh Leib is son-in-law of the rabbi Efraim Fischel, which would exp
2 CONC lain the name Jute Fischel, which they estimate is born about 1620.
2 CONT --------------------
