2 CONT Holesov, 1819:  [household #32.a] FRANKL, Abraham
2 CONT
2 CONT “Abraham Frankel, age 61, d. household #32, 14 Dec 1832.” [He was actually 58 at the time.]
2 CONT
2 CONT He m. in Holesov, 30 Mar 1794, Jachwid Zwillinger, aka “Jachwid Isack”, “Zartl Isack”, b. 1769, dau of R’ Isak b. Abraham [Teomim-Zwillinger] and Chaja [Anna] Zwillinger; d. in House No. 32, Holesov, 26 Feb 1845, age 76.  Her deat
2 CONC h record calls her “Anna Frankl, age 76, widow of familianten Abraham Frankl.”  Marriage record:  “Abr. Frankel, age 18, household #32, and Jachwid Zwillinger, age 24, m. 30 Mar 1794 [witnesses:  Jakob Konig, Abraham Zwillinger].”
2 CONC
