2 CONC t by the surname Zwillinger.  He is listed in a book of prominent rabbis as:  Teomim, Jakob, burgerlich [civil name] Jak. Zwillinger, gest. 5 Jan. 1850 in Czempin, Prov. Posen.
2 CONT
