1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Abraham Leib Zwillinger was the son of R' Salomon ["Simcha"] Nathan Teomim-Zwillinger and his second wife Rebeka.  He was born in Sokal and lived there into adulthood before later moving to nearby Tartakow.  He die
2 CONC d in House No. 13 in Tartakow about December 1880, age 76.
2 CONT
2 CONT His first wife, whom he married in Sokal c1829, was Scheindl.  She died in Sokal about 1834.  His second wife, whom he m. in Sokal, c1835, was Henie Gitel, b. Sokal, c1819, d. Tartakow, c1865, age 47.  His third wife, whom he marr
2 CONC ied in Tartakow on 14 Aug 1866, was Chane, a widow born in 1821.  “Abraham Zwilinger, age 62, widower, and Chane, age 45, widow, m. Tartakow, 14 Aug 1866.”
