1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Amalie [Mirl] [Emilie] Zwillinger, b. O’Besztercze, 1798, died in Hatvan, Heves megye, Hungary, 31 Aug 1870, age 72.  Death record:  “Amalie Lippe, age 72, b. Puchovi, Trencsen Comit, widow of Rabiner, d. Hatvan, 3
2 CONC 1 Aug 1870.”  See:  https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CS8Q-1SD7?i=181&cat=260882.  Recorded again in Hatvan Jewish records:  https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CS8S-PDCD?i=56&cat=260886
2 CONT
2 CONT She m. c1818, R’ Wolf [Wilhelm] [Farkas] Lippe, Chief Rabbi of Gyongyos, b. Puchov, Trencin megye, 20 Jun 1792; d. Gyongyos, 9 Jan 1851, age 58.  
2 CONT
