2 CONC use he was a younger son, he was not allowed to legally marry.  As a result, their union was not recognized and their children were all officially born illegitimate.  Hindl Klopper predeceased him -- she died in household #22 on 8
2 CONC  Dec 1844, age 47.
2 CONT
