1 NOTE {geni:about_me} death:  https://www.jewishgen.org/databases/jgdetail_2.php  TRENCSINER, Ilona	- - -	95-03 22-Apr-1887 71	Simon Trencsiner	Pest Budapest Local Gov't Pest-Pilis-Solt-Kiskun	b.Vorosvar; wife of Simon Trencsiner; maide
2 CONC n name Zwillinger	LDS 642982, Vol. 51
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Leonora [Magdalena] [Helena] [Ilona] Zwillinger, b. Vorosvar, 1815, died in Pest, 22 Apr 1887, in her 72nd year of age. She was one of four daughters living in her father’s household in Vorosvar, 1821-1822. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Pest, 1833: #1113 – ZWILLINGER, Marcus, age 54 yrs., b. Veresvar; wife Francisca, age 46 yrs., b. Brunn; dau Anna, age ¾ yrs., b. Pesth; dau Magdalena, age 18 yrs., b. Veresvar; and maid. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She m. Simon Trentschin [Trencsiner], b. Cece, Fejer megye, Hungary, 1798; d. Pest, 12 Nov 1882, age 84 yrs. He was a chandler by occupation. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Pest, 1846: TRENTSCHIN, Simon, age 39 yrs., b. Szedzl; wife Magdalena, age 28 yrs., b. Vorosvar; son Jacob, age 5 yrs., b. Pest, daughter Fani, age 4 mos., b. Pest; and a boarder. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Pest, 1857: TRENTSINER, Simon, b. Pest, 1800; wife Leny, b. Pest, 1816; son Jakab, b. Pest, 1841; and dau Fany, b. Pest, 1846.
