1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lobl Herschel Zwillinger, aka “L. Herman Zwillinger”, aka “Armin Zwillinger”, b. Vorosvar, 1818; d. Pest, 26 Dec 1892. Death record: “Armin Zwillinger, age 75 yrs., b. Vorosvar, d. Pest, 26 Dec 1892.” 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the only son living in his father’s household in Vorosvar, 1821-1822. He is not seen in his father’s household in the Pest censuses of 1833 and 1836 – likely, he was living and working in another household during those year
2 CONC s, either in Pest or in Vorosvar. However, he was almost certainly this man living in Pest in 1846, although his age was 28 rather than 30 – Pest, 1846: ZWILLINGER, “N” [= first name not given], age 30 yrs., boarding, b. Vorosvar.
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT He resided in Pest for all of his adult life, and was a salesman in that city. He m. in Pest, 18 Jun 1848, Franciska [Fanni] Strasser, b. Pest, 1822, dau of Lazar Strasser; d. Pest, 8 Apr 1891, age 69 yrs. Marriage record: “Herman
2 CONC n Zwillinger, age 27 yrs., of Pest, son of Markus Zwillinger, and Fanny Strasser, age 26 yrs., of Pest, dau of Lazar Strasser, m. Pest, 18 Jun 1848.” 
2 CONT
2 CONT Pest, 1857: #3518 – ZWILLINGER, Herman, b. Pest, 1818; wife Fanny, b. Pest, 1823; son Leopold, b. Pest, 1850; son Jakab, b. Pest, 1851; dau Rosy, b. Pest, 1853; plus maid, FANTUS, Rosy, b. Pest, 1842 [daughter of Theresia (Zwillin
2 CONC ger) Fantus]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Pest, 1869: Zwillinger, Hermann, b. Vorosvar, 1818; wife Franziska, b. Pest, 1825; son Leopold, b. Pest, 1850; dau Rosa, b. Pest, 1852; son Jakob, b. Pest, 1853; dau Bertha, b. Pest, 1859; and son Markus, b. Pest, 1860.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3QS7-L9PH-Q9QS-L?i=286
