1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Moses Weinreb, b.Holesov,  household #5, 12 Jan 1806, was the only son of Juda Lobl Weinreb and Ester (Pollak).  
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, whom he married in a Jewish ceremony c1830, was Tekla Kohn, b. 14 Jun 1810, dau of Lipmann and Leonora (Fuchs) Kohn.  They had several children together prior to legally marrying in 1849.
2 CONT
