1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Herschel  Zwillinger, aka Herman Zwillinger, was born in Bosing about 1788 and  died in Zsambek, Pest, Hungary bef. 1839. His wife was Johanna, b. c1788, deceased by 1837.
2 CONT
2 CONT He moved to Zsambek in early adulthood. He is seen in Zsambek census records for 1821-1822 (when he is erroneously listed as "Jacobus") and for 1830-1831.
2 CONT
2 CONT Zsambek, 1821-1822: ZWILLINGER, Jacobus, "poor", with wife, two sons, two daughters
2 CONT
2 CONT Zsambek, 1830-1831: ZWILLINGER, Herman, "poor", with wife, two sons, two daughers
