1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lobl [Leopold] Zwillinger, b. Bosing, c.mid-1794, went first from Bosing to Tornyasnemeti, Borsod-Abauj-Zemplen megye, then to Ungwar, Hungary [now Uzhhorod, Ukraine]. He lived there for several years before moving
2 CONC  to Pest shortly before his death. He d. in Pest, 20 Jul 1836, “age 38”, but he was likelier about 42 at death. Death record: “Lob Zwillinger, age 38 yrs., handler, ‘aus Ungwar’, died Pest, 20 Jul 1836.” 
2 CONT
2 CONT His first wife’s name was Fradl, b. c1795, deceased early in life. His second wife was Terez [Rosa], b.Pest, 1795, d. Pest, 17 Jan 1848.
