1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Markus [Meir] Zwillinger, b. House No. 6, Mahr. Weisskirchen, 1 Jun 1800, son of Jonas and Anna (Deutsch) Zwillinger, died in House No. 15, Mahr. Weisskirchen, 21 Apr 1826, age 25.  He was named in honor of his pat
2 CONC ernal grandfather, R’ Markus (Meir) Teomim-Zwillinger (1732-1794).  He was the “Meir Zwillinger” whose stone is still standing in Hranice Jewish cemetery.  
2 CONT
2 CONT He was residing in House No. 15 when he m. in Mahr. Weisskirchen, Dec 1823, Sara Adler, b. Mahr. Weisskirchen, 1798.  Witnesses to the marriage were Wolf Adler and “Jonas Zwilling”.
