2 CONT While some claim he was the son-in-law of Rabbi Yaakov Emdin, ( Meor haChaim, 1960 p.22, Shut Le'Horos Nasson V1 p.15 ) others dispute that.
2 CONT
2 CONT As far as I as able to research I was not able to find proof that she was indeed the daughter of Rabbi Emdin (and found the basis of those claims questionable to go along with it as of now). MH:N61  MH:I742
