2 CONT *[http://www.geni.com/profile/documents/3381491   '''Abraham Joshua Heschel Biography].  Click on and Read Document: Abraham Joshua Heschel of Cracow (Chanikas Hatorah) AJH Pages 1 - 2 ] ("Full size tab" on upper left corner of do
