1 NOTE {geni:about_me} It says: "Mourners please gather. Stand here and mourn. Our spirit was smashed by lamenting our mother. Our head's crown has fallen. Mourn on a mother in Israel. Wife of a member her justice is like god's mountains
2 CONC . Good things she has done."
2 CONT Of the rest I can read only some words from which I see that this part depicts various ways she helped poor people.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT This was written by Isaac Shapiro about his family. My father JACOB JOSEPH SHAPIRO was the son of the gaon BORUCH SHAPIRO, otherwise known as BOCHIE SHAPIRO, the Czisover rabbi and of RASHI MIREL, his wife, who was the daughter of
2 CONC  rabbi MARDECAI HALEVY, district Rabbi at Tiktin, became rabbi at the age of 18; his brother ZEBI DAVID ISAAC HALEVY was rabbi at Krakow; both were sons of the great gaon and Hased ISAAC HALEVY of Lwow, who became rabbi in Chelm, 
2 CONC and later at Krakow; he was the son of MORDECAI HALEVY (Rabbi) at Lwow, whose father was the great and holy gaon JEHOSHUA HALEVY called “Reitzes” who was a brother to the holy gaon CHAIM REITZES, Rabbi of Lwow, both of whom were m
2 CONC artyred in 5488 (1727); they were the sons of the great gaon and Rabbi ISAAC HALEVY and grandsons of the aforementioned ISAAC HALEVY, who was the son-inlaw of the great gaon ARIE LEIB, Rabbi in Gluga and Amsterdam, who was the son
2 CONC  of Rabbi SAUL, Rabbi at Brisk, later at Krakow; his father Rabbi HESHIL was Rabbi of Krakow; he was the son of the great, JACOB LUBLINER; his father HESHIL was the son of the gaon JACOB LUBLINER; His father HESHIL was the son of 
2 CONC the gaon EPHRAIM NAPTHALI HERSH WEIL of Ladimir; He was the son of JONAH WEIL RABBI of Bamberg, Switzerland, and of Bavaria; his father was RABBI MEIR WEIL, CHIEF Rabbi of Ulma; he was the son of the gaon Rabbi JACOB WEIL, chief R
2 CONC abbi of Nirenberg, who was a direct descendant of MEIER BEN BARUCH of Rothenburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT The above SAUL OF BRISK was the son-in-law of ARIE LIEB, who was known as Rabbi “Lieb the Tall,” Chief Rabbi of Krakow, who was the son of the gaon and miracle man LECHARIAH MENDIL; he was the son of BENJAMIN BENISH, Rabbi of Pose
2 CONC n, who was the son-in-law of MOSES ISSERLES, whose father was CHAIM, Rabbi of Friedburg, whose brother was M. ‘H. ‘R.! “L”. of Prague; he was the son of the gaon and hasid ANPHTALI HERSCH, who was the son of the great gaon, hasid 
2 CONC and lecturer ISAAC of Lwow.
2 CONT
2 CONT ARIE LEIB of Gluga, mentioned above, had two sons’ 1. SAUL, who was chief Rabbi at Amsterdam, Holland; 2. ZEBI HIRSCH, Rabbi in Berlin; he had the following sons-in-law; 1. ISAAC HALEVY of Lwow and Krakow (mentioned above), and 2.
2 CONC  was Rabbi SAUL, Rabbi of the Hague, Holland; 3. the great gaon AARON JOSHUA, Rabbi in Rawitzk and Konigsberg.
2 CONT
2 CONT ZEBI HIRSCH, of Berlin, mentioned above, had three sons: 1. SAUL, rabbi in Frankfort-on-the-Main; 2. SOLOMON, rabbi in London; 3. DAVID TOBIAS ASHUR, who lived in POLAND, Whose shoulders escaped the Weight of the Rabbinate.
2 CONT
2 CONT ARIE LEIB of Gluga, mentioned above, was the son-in-law of the great gaon and the famous Rabbi ZEBI HIRSCH ASHKENAZI, who was a famous Rabbi known throughout the world by the name of “HAKAM ZEBI,” whose father was JACOB VILNA, who
2 CONC  was Rabbi in the Old Auben, and whose father was BENJAMIN ZEEV “Z” “K.”
2 CONT
2 CONT JACOB VILNA, mentioned above was the son-in-law of the gaon EPHRAIM HAKOHEN, whose father-in-law ELIAH, a grandson of the gaon and Kaballist, who was known as BAAL SHEM of Chelm or Kelem.
2 CONT
2 CONT HAKAM ZEBI, mentioned above, was the son-in-law of the great rabbi MESHULEM ZALMAN NEWMARK “MIRELS, “D. 1706, Rabbi of Hamburg, who was the son of JACOB NEWMARK “MIRELS,” a son of NAPHTALI HERSCH, who was Rabbi at Fulda, a grandso
2 CONC n of “M. H. R. M.” Padua. HAKAM ZEBI had five sons: 1. Rabbi JACOB EMDIN; 2. Rabbi MESEULEM ZALMAN, chief Rabbi at Ostrobe; 3. NATHAN ASHKENAZI, who was chief Rabbi at Broady, (Brod); 4. DAVID, Rabbi at Lutsk; 5. ISSAC ASHKENAZI o
2 CONC f Lwow.
2 CONT
2 CONT JACOB EMDEN (Emdin), mentioned above, was the father of 1. MESHALEM ZALMAN, Rabbi in London; 2. MEIER ASHKENZAI (16th Century), Rabbi at Constantin , and the father-in-law of the famous gaon, HAIM KATZ RAPPOPORT, Rabbi at Austrasi
2 CONC a.
2 CONT
2 CONT NATHAN ASHKENAZI, mentioned above, was the father of the following gaonim; 1. EPHRAIM ASHKENAZI; 2. JACOB MOSES, the father of JACOB, who was Rabbi in Lissa and Styria.
2 CONT
2 CONT HESHIL, mention above, was the son-in-law of JEHUDAH WAHL, a grandson of “M. H. R. M.” of Padua.
2 CONT
2 CONT Rabbi LEIB THE TALL, mentioned above was the father of ZECHARIAH MENDEL, 18TH Century, rabbi at Belz, and son-in-law of the gaon and shining light EPHRAIM FISHEL, Rabbi of Lwow and the District, who was a descendant of WISHEL, the
2 CONC  son-in-law of “H. M.R. L.,” whose lineage is traced back to RASHI, who descended (10 generations) from JOHANAN HA-SAND-HILLEL HASOKON (Hillel the Elder) one of the Tanaim of the Talmud, whose lineage is traced back to King David.
2 CONT
2 CONT ARIE LEIB of Gluga, mentioned above, was the grandson of Saul Wahl, King of Poland, who was the son of “M. H. R. M.” of Padua.
2 CONT
2 CONT Not sure about this either..  http://cemetery.jewish.org.pl/id_47602/info/back_1:1/__Szpiro.html cemetery	Warszawa (Okopowa) sector	39 row	14 number	24 sex	F surname	Szpiro first name	 hebrew name	Rasha Mirel fathers name	Tzvi hus
2 CONC bands name	Baruch maiden name	 date of birth (m/d/y) (m/d/r)	 date of death (m/d/y) (m/d/r)	1/1/1884 additional info	ze Szczuczyna http://szukajwarchiwach.pl/72/200/0/-/18/skan/full/tPIQ8OrBMMpmZdSMbfao7g
2 CONT
2 CONT Found this.. but it is questionable.  http://szukajwarchiwach.pl/.../full/tPIQ8OrBMMpmZdSMbfao7g
2 CONT
2 CONT #131 Warsaw, Dec 22 1883 / Jan 3 1884 Moszek Bukszpan (Moses Boxwood, 29 yo) and Moszek Gierman (Moses Herman, 42 yo), both residents of Warsaw, stated that 2 days ago in Warsaw Rasza Mirel Szapiro (Rachel Miriam Shapiro) died, an
2 CONC  80 yo widowed daughter of Benisz (Yiddish Baruch) and Sura (Sara) spouses Zyller (a lot of possible alternative notations), both deceased, she left seven sons THE SEVEN SONS could be right.. but Baruch and Sura? don't make sense.
2 CONT
2 CONT : "Ateret Yehoshua" for the family of the Pnei Yehoshua. discusses his children.  He said the book is in Hebrew only. It is available via  Otzar Hachochma (paid access)  http://www.otzar.org/otzaren/indexeng.asp
2 CONT
