1 NAME Reizel /Ashkenazi/
2 GIVN Reizel
2 SURN Ashkenazi
2 _MARNM Horowitz
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1811
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} According to Rabbi Hirsch Horowitz of Dresden in his article "Die jüdische Gemeinde Opatow und ihre Rabbiner" in Monatsschrift für Geschichte und Wissenschaft des Judentums, vol.74, 1930, the wife of Rabbi Meschule
2 CONC m Horowitz was Reisel Mendelsburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Here is the article: http://sammlungen.ub.uni-frankfurt.de/cm/periodical/titleinfo/2849334
2 CONT
2 CONT What sources are there for the claim that Reizel Aschkenazi was his wife? Did he have two wives?
2 CONT
2 CONT Comment: In Unbroken Chain 3rd Edition Volume 4, p. 566 12.1, Reyze b. Meshulam Zalman Ashkenazi is shown as spouse of Meshulam Issachar Horvits of Stanislaw
2 CONT
2 CONT ======
2 CONT
2 CONT A Hebrew source  (appears in her husbands Hebrew information) claims:
2 CONT
2 CONT נשא לאשה את מרת רייזל, נכדתו של הרב הגאון משה משולם איגרא, אבד"ק פרעסבורג, שאשתו מרת רבקה אסתר היתה בתו של הרב הגאון האדיר רבן של ישראל מו"ה יצחק איש הורוויץ אבד"ק אה"ו
2 CONT
2 CONT i.e.
2 CONT That Reisel was the grand-daughter of Rabbi Moshe Meshulam Igra     אבד"ק פרעסבורג whose wife's name was Rivka Ester and who was the daughter of Rabbi Yitschak Ish-Horowitz.
