2 CONT ----------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT From the JewishEncyclopedia.com (1906):
2 CONT
2 CONT Ḥayyim ha-Kohen Rapoport of Ostrog, Volhynia, author of "Mayim Ḥayyim," responsa (Jitomir, 1858), who died in 1839, was Ḥayyim b. Simḥah [HaKohen Rapaport]'s great-grandson.
