2 CONC y/6000000003050663153]. Furthermore, one of his daughters-in-law was the sister of my aunt, the second wife of the aforementioned Rabbi Meir. Furthermore again, Reb Avraham Halpern was a double in-law with Reb Hertz Bernstein of L
2 CONC wow.[https://www.geni.com/people/R-Jacob-Naftali-Herz-Berenstein-of-Lvov/6000000022410037791]''' (Written by https://www.geni.com/people/R-Markus-Mordechai-Zeev-Braude/6000000003050663528, here: https://www.jewishgen.org/Yizkor/st
2 CONC anislawow-arim/sta098.html). There are three relationships asserted here: 1) Av. Heilprin and Meir Kristianpoler were  brothers-in-law, 2) a daughter-in-law of Av. Heilprin was sister of Meir Kristianpoler's second wife, 3) Meir K
2 CONC ristianpoler was a double in-law with Hertz Bernstein. Of these only #3 is captures by the current GENI tree. I do not know how the others may be incorporated into the GENI tree. [21 FEB 2024]
