1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.ics.uci.edu/~dan/genealogy/Krakow/Families/Hochgelerter.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Apparently Naftul Szper had the double name that appeared in at least two records: his daughter’s Tauba Szyfra’s birth in 1820 (RC) and her marriage certificate as well (the reason for this usage of his second name Wolf only in th
2 CONC ese two documents is very simple: every single person that planned to get married had to provide his/ her birth certificate’s copy. So Tauba Szyfra received for her marriage the exact copy of her birth certificate in which her fat
2 CONC her’s name was Wolf. But at her marriage his more common name Naftul was added too because he used it more often)
2 CONT
