1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 07/2018 Gisele G., (Abraham's 2nd great granddaughter) note: With the help of Mr. Neil Rosenstein (www.neilrosenstein.com), found this reference to Rabbi Abraham at JewishGen Yizkor book for Szydłowiec, Poland:
2 CONT
2 CONT "In the middle of the 19th century, R. Abraham Katzenelbogen (c. 1867), a disciple of "The Seer of Lublin", served as rabbi."
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.jewishgen.org/yizkor/pinkas_poland/pol7_00557.html
2 CONT
2 CONT The Seer of Lublin, for reference: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yaakov_Yitzchak_of_Lublin
2 CONT
2 CONT Kacelenbogen illustrious Rabbi family that may be related to to the Rabbi: https://www.avotaynu.com/books/UnbrokenChain-1.html
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT According to his grandson Pedro Baumfeld, Awrum was a Rabbi - known as “Der Szydłowezer Rebbe” (Rabbi from the city of Szydłowiec).
2 CONT
2 CONT Pedro also calls him repeatedly in his biography "Rabbi Awrum Krechiver" but Pedro granddaughter Gisele found the following death record at JRI-Poland that might be of Awrum:
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Szydlowiec PSA Births, Marriages, Deaths 1878-1911
2 CONT
2 CONT Surname	                Given Name	Year	      Type	Akta
2 CONT
2 CONT KACELENBOGEN 	Abram Izrail 	1910 	D 	58 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT תלמיד של החוזה מלובלין והיהודי הקדוש והרב ירחמיאל מפרשיסחא. 
