2 CONT There is a problem with this pedigree and surrounding branches as to the coordination of dates. For example, how can Yitzach Katz (https://www.geni.com/people/R-Isaac-Rappoport/6000000006712214351) have been born c.1687, while his
2 CONC  daughter (https://www.geni.com/people/%D7%90%D7%A9%D7%AA-%D7%A8-%D7%90%D7%A9%D7%A8-%D7%90%D7%A0%D7%A9%D7%99%D7%9C-%D7%A2%D7%A0%D7%96%D7%99%D7%9C-%D7%A8%D7%90%D7%A4%D7%A4%D7%95%D7%A8%D7%98/6000000003454724646) whose birth year is 
2 CONC 'estimated between 1690 and 1690', have been married to a man, Asher Anschel (https://www.geni.com/people/R-Asher-Anschel/6000000003454724638) whose dates are 1640-c1717? This is one example of many. The fix is not as easy as goin
2 CONC g to one profile and adjusting the dates there so that the particular profile works-- because that could make surrounding profiles stop making sense. Researchers into this area need to look at the area as a whole to locate the tro
2 CONC uble spots and then begin filling-in specific, estimated birth years for the principals and branches to identify possible pedigree errors in the tree..(25 DEC 2025)
