1 NOTE {geni:about_me} It is a distinct possibility, although as yet unproven, that he was identical with Markus [Meir] Zwillinger, b. 17 Jul 1799, raised as the son of his maternal grandparents, Abraham and Freydl Zwillinger. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The theory: in 1806, following the deaths of their two sons, Markus and Isack – and perhaps with their own mother Channa falling ill – the two eldest Tauber children were brought into the household of Channa’s parents and were rai
2 CONC sed as their own. Retrospectively, the birth of Markus was entered (with an incorrect date) into the Holesov record book. This is supported by a clear indication that it was inserted into the 1799 page at some subsequent point.
