2 CONC and ROTH, Elias, b. Lemes, Ungarn, 1854, ledig, rabbinical student.   [Insert:  “Josef Haas, b. 18 Oct 1853, son of Hermann Haas and Lotti geb. Zwillinger”].  
2 CONT
