1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Selig Limon, aka “Selig Limann”, aka “Salomon Limonn”, b. household #46, 7 May 1792, “son of Nathan Leman and Sara Lobl”.   He was familiant No. 123.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Holesov, 1819:  [household #46.c] LEMAN, Selig.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Holesov, 1830:  [household #42.a] LIMONN, Salomon.   
2 CONT
2 CONT Holesov, 1857:  [household #75] LIMON, Selig, b. 1798; wife Anna, b. 1799; dau Sali, b. 1833; dau Netti, b. 1835; and dau Zilli, b. 1837.  
