2 CONT
2 CONT He m. 16 Aug 1814, Tscharna [Anna] [Chaja] Frankl, aka “Scharloti Frankl”, b. 20 Feb 1798, erroneously called “Sara” in her birth record.  Marriage record:  “Selig Leman, age 23, household #45, and Tscharna Frankl, age 18, m. 16 A
2 CONC ug 1814 [witness:  Abraham Frankel].”  She d. between 1857 and 1869.  
2 CONT
2 CONT On 18 Jul 1823, Selig Limon sold his rights to household #46 to Joseph Zwillinger.  He d. in Holesov, 17 Dec 1871 — gravestone still standing.
