1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Pinkus Lob Redlichh, b. 16 Sep 1804, was the only child born to the second marriage of Allexander Redlich to Sara (Fischl) Redlich.  He was Familianten #179 in Holesov.
2 CONT
2 CONT Holesov, 1830:  [household 32.a] REDLICH, Pinkus – previous occupant:  SKRANKA, Abraham
2 CONT
2 CONT Holesov, 1857:  [household #49] REDLICH, Pinkus, b. 1804; wife Pepi, b. 1814; son Adolf recte Abraham, b. 8 May 1839; son Wilhelm, b. 7 Sep 1842; dau Hanni, b. 1844; dau Katti, b. 1848; and dau Julia, b. 1843 [*error for 1851].
2 CONT
2 CONT He died between 1857 and 1868.
2 CONT
2 CONT He m. 1st, 27 Jan 1828, Sara [Rosalia] [Rosel] [Theresia] Teomim, 10 years his senior, b. household #3, Holesov, 20 Nov 1794, dau of Jonas and Eva (Ochs) Teomim.  Marriage record:  “Pinkus Redlich, age 20, household #38, and Rosel
2 CONC  Theomim, age 34, m. 27 Jan 1828 [witness:  Markus Redlich].”  She died on 6 Oct 1828:  “Theresia Redlich, age 29, d. household #31, 6 Oct 1828.”
2 CONT
2 CONT He m. 2nd, 26 Dec 1831, Paulina [Polexenia] [Fani] Frankl, b. household #32, Holesov, 12 Dec 1808, dau of Abraham Frankl.  Marriage record:  “Pinkus Redlich, age 28, widower, household #32, and Fani Frankel, age 25, m. 26 Dec 1831
2 CONC  [witness:  Abr. Frankel].”  She d. on 7 Apr 1837:  “Fani Redlich, age 27, d. household #32, 7 Apr 1837.”
2 CONT
2 CONT He m. 3rd, 20 Feb 1838, Pessl [Paulina] [Paula] [Pepi] Herzka, b. 3 Nov 1814, dau of Abraham and Freidl (Dienstag) Herzka.  Marriage record:   “Pinkus Redlich, age 32, widower, household #32, and Pepi Herzka, age 22, m. 20 Feb 183
2 CONC 8 [witness:  Lobl Mandler].”  She was a widow living in Holesov in 1869 -- Holesov, 1869: [pg. 169] REDLICH, Pepi, b. 1810, widow; dau Hanni, b. 1846; dau Katti, b. 1848; and dau Julia, b. 1851.  She was deceased by March 1873 whe
2 CONC n a granddaughter was named in her honor.
