1 NOTE {geni:about_me} His death record correctly identifies his father as “Israel Louis Zwillinger” [aka Israel Leib Zwillinger] but wrongly lists his mother as “Sarah Woretsky”.  She was in fact Malka Zwillinger, maiden name unknown.  
2 CONC “Woretsky” was probably “Moretsky”, the maiden name of Moses’ first wife, Chana [“Annie”], and her mother’s name was “Sara Rywa Moretsky”.  Whoever supplied this information (one of Moses’ children) almost certainly confused their
2 CONC  paternal grandmother with their maternal grandmother.
2 CONT
2 CONT Translation of Hebrew on his son Louis Zwillinger’s gravestone:  “Here lies Israel Leib, son of R’ Moshe Tzvi...”
