1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Moses Hersch Zwillinger, aka Morris Zwillinger, was married in 1878, to Lena ["Libby"] Lustig (1853-1941).  They lived for several years in Tartakow before emigrating to the United States in 1890.  The  family is s
2 CONC een living on Lewis Street in Manhattan, 1900, and on Broome Street, Manhattan, in 1910. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Morris was a patient at the NY State Hospital at Central Islip, NY, when he died on 29 June 1913.  His widow survived him by many years, dying in Manhattan, 23 Nov 1941, age 88.
