2 CONT The child’s father was Simon Koch, b. Prossnitz, 1819, son of Josef and Rivka Koch.  They went on to have three more children (Hani, Regi, and Sali) before their legal marriage in Prossnitz, 23 Sep 1861.  They subsequently had one
2 CONC  more daughter (Charlotte).
2 CONT
