1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Paulina (Napajedl) Zwillinger was born in Holesov in 1795.  Widowed in 1844, she moved to Prostejov with her children prior to 1860.  She d. in House No. 44, Prostejov, 11 Sep 1869, “age 78” [but actually age 74].
2 CONT
2 CONT She was widow Paulina HOFFMANN when she married widower Gabriel Zwillinger in Holesov, 31 Aug 1824. Marriage record:  “Gabriel Zwillinger, age 32, widower, household #22, Holesov, and Pessel Hofmann, age 29, widow, m. Holesov, 31 
2 CONC Aug 1824.”  
2 CONT
2 CONT Holesov, 1857:  ZWILLINGER, Paulina, b. 1795, widow, of Holesov #100; her sons, Michael, b. 1833, day laborer, and Lobel, b. 1836; her daughters, Anna, b. 1819, and Johanna, b. 1824.. Also, her son, Moritz, born 1827, Holesov #100
2 CONC , his wife, Fani, born 1831.
2 CONT
