1 NOTE {geni:about_me} His Hebrew name was "Jehosua".  Simon Husserl was the eldest son of Salamon and Franciska (Zwillinger) Husserl and resided in House No. 80 in Vorosvar [two houses away from his parents, who resided in House No. 78]
2 CONC .   Simon died in Vorosvar on 15 January 1886, age 65.
