1 NOTE {geni:about_me} David Husserl lived first in Gran-Szent Tamas, Esztergom megye before moving to Arad about 1862.  He was a merchant / peddler, and died in Arad on 23 Apr 1879.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gran-Szent Tamas / Esztergom Jewish records:  “David Husserl, age 31, of Gran, kaufmann, b. Vorosvar, s/o Salamon and Franziska Husserl, and Fany Bauer, age 23, b. Vorosvar, d/o Markus and Anna Bauer of Gran, m. Gran, 26 May 1853”
