1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Julia Fantus, b. Nagy-Teteny, Budapest, 2 Jun 1838, died in Bronx, New York, 23 Apr 1923, in her 85th year of age.  Her death certificate incorrectly identifies her parents as “Josef Fantusz” and “Mary Weiss”.  
2 CONT
2 CONT She m. Leopold [Lipot] Brust, b. Budapest, 6 May 1835, son of Hermann and Terezia (Wolf) Brust; d. Budapest, 16 Feb 1890, in his 55th year of age.  Julia came to the U.S. in 1906.
