1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Markus Emanuel [Mayer] [Mano] Zwillinger, b. Pest, 25 Apr 1860, was named in honor of his paternal grandfather, Markus [Meir] Zwillinger (1761-1859), who died six months prior to his birth.  He died in Budapest, 28
2 CONC  Jan 1905, in his 45th year of age.  He was m. Maria Schulz, who was Catholic, and soon converted to Catholicism.  Emanuel Markus Zwillinger, b. Ungarn, 25 Apr 1860, converted to Roman Catholicism in Vienna, 2 Jan 1890.  His occup
2 CONC ation was that of kaufman.
