2 CONT
2 CONT Holesov, 1819:  [household #14b] WEINREB, Jakob
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in Holesov on 10 Jul 1822:  “Jak. Herschl Weinreb, age 68, d. household #14, 10 Jul 1822.”
2 CONT
2 CONT His first wife was Loisia, b. 1754.  She d. in Holesov on 24 May 1784:  "Loisia [no surname], age 30, d. household #14, 24 May 1784." 
2 CONT
2 CONT He m. 2nd, in Holesov, 20 Mar 1786, Barbara Beer, aka “Breindl Beer”, b. 1761.  His marriage record refers to him as "Herschl Moises".  Holesov marriage entry:  “Herschl Moises [no surname], age 30, widower, household #14, and Bre
2 CONC indl Beer, age 24, m. 20 Mar 1786 [witnesses:  Moises Herzka, Jakob Pollak]. 
