2 CONC ding in Holesov, but his exact date of death is not legible.  He was familiant No. 120 in Holesov.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Holesov, 1830:  [household #5h] – 3. – GLUCKLICH, Jacob.  Subsequent head-of-house:  WEINREB, Kalmann.  
2 CONT
