1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He was Familianten #44 in Holesov.  “Jaakov Deutsch” d. Holesov, 3 Aug 1857 – gravestone still standing in Holesov.
2 CONT
2 CONT He m. in Holesov, 22 Jan 1806, Pessel [Paula] [Pepi] Zwillinger, b. Holesov, 1781, dau of Samuel and Sara (Glata) Zwillinger; d. in House No. 14, Holesov, 25 Sep 1849, age 68.  Death record:  “Pessel recte Pepi Deutsch, age 68, wi
2 CONC fe of familiant #44 Jakob Deutsch, d. household #14, 25 Sep 1849.”  The stone of “Pesl Deutsch” still stands in Holesov.  
2 CONT
