2 CONT He m. 1st, 12 Apr 1798, Michla Klopper, b. 1769, dau of Joachim Klopper.  Marriage record:  “Jos. Fischer, age 21 [should be 25], household #38, and Machla Kloper, age 24, m. 12 Apr 1798 [witnesses:  Joach. Klopper, Isak Fischer].
