1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Markus [Malkiel] Zwillinger, b. Zsambek, 1810, died in Gran-Szent Tamas, Esztergom megye, Hungary, 6 Apr 1871, age 61, of lung fever.  Living in Bajot, Komarom-Esztergom megye, Hungary, in 1848 [age 42, but actuall
2 CONC y 38].  His birthplace is listed as Sarisap, Hungary, but that seems to be where he first went as a young adult.  He m. Fanny Weisz, b. 1816, d. Gran-Szent Tamas, Esztergom, 7 Sep 1898, age 82 [buried 9 Sep 1898].  In the 1848 cen
2 CONC sus, both Fanny and her daughter Johanna are erroneously listed as "Maria".
