1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Moises [Moritz] Zwillinger, b. Tornyasnemeti, Borsod-Abauj-Zemplen, near Szerencs, c1817; d. Pest, 11 May 1873, “age 68” [but likelier, age 65 or 66]. Death record: “Mor Zwillinger, age 68 yrs., b. Szerencs, d. Pes
2 CONC t, 11 May 1873.” 
2 CONT
2 CONT He appears to have spent his childhood in Pest, and was working in the same household as his first cousin Charlotte in 1833 -- Pest, 1833: [p. 200/378] MAYER, Joseph, age 26; wife, Charlotte, age 25, b. Pesth; dau Rosina, age 3, b
2 CONC . Pesth; dau Christina, age 1 ½, b. Pesth; plus VALTNER, Ignatz, b. D. Kiraly, age 18 yrs; ZWILLINGER, Moritz, age 14 yrs. [*likelier age 16], b. Pesth; and ZWILLINGER, Charlotte, maid, age 15 yrs., b. Veszprem. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Pest, 1836: ZWILLINGER, Moritz, b. Pest, age 16 [*likelier age 19], in Lisauer household. 
2 CONT
2 CONT As a young adult, he moved first to Szigetvar where he was married (c1837). In 1840, he was boarding in Pest and working there (without his wife and young son) -- Pest, 1840: ZWILLINGER, Moritz, age 22 yrs., b. “Telarnamet”. He re
2 CONC sided in Szigetvar until about 1849 when he and his family moved to Pest. They remained there until his death, with the exception of a short period of time when they took residence in Obuda (1853-1854). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Pest, 1853: ZWILLINGER, Moritz [in index]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Pest, 1869: [pg. 901/042] No. 17 – ZWILLINGER, Moritz, “taylohner”, b. Toronyas Nemeth / Katschauer Com./, 1815; son Filipp, b. Pest, 1850; son Albert, b. Pest, 1864; wife Magdalena, b. Gr. Sigeth, 1821; dau Theres, b. Alt. Ofen, 
2 CONC 1853; and dau Regina, b. Pest, 1855. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He m. in Szigetvar, c1838, Magdalena [Leni] Grunfeld, b. Szigetvar, 1821, dau of Emanuel [Mano] and Sarolta (Alt) Grunfeld; d. Pest, 22 May 1887, age 66 yrs. [Her paternal grandfather was Abraham Grunfeld, 1763-c1843]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-417064622-2-43631/moritz-moses-zwillinger-in-myheritage-family-trees MyHeritage Family Trees] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 15 2023, 1
2 CONC 4:37:36 UTC''
