2 CONT Mayer [Maier] [Meir] Zwillinger, b. Hotzenplotz, 22 Aug 1840, son of Jacob and Anna (Eisler) Zwillinger, died in Troppau, 3 May 1896, age 56.  
2 CONT
2 CONT His 1st wife was Agnes [Esterl] Gesler, b. 1844, d. in Hotzenplotz, 21 May 1872, age 28.  
2 CONT
2 CONT He m. 2nd, c1874, Sofie Welsch, b. Hotzenplotz, 30 Sep 1848, d. Troppau, 8 Feb 1931, age 82.  
2 CONT
