1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Philipp Zwillinger, b. House No. 16, Mahr. Weisskirchen, 1 Apr 1826, son of Markus and Sara (Adler) Zwillinger, died in Vienna, 30 Dec 1894, age 68.  He m. 1854, Johanna Otto, b. 1832, d. in Vienna, 13 May 1913, ag
2 CONC e 81.  They were the parents of six children, five of whom predeceased them.
2 CONT
2 CONT His obituary, published in the Neue Frei Presse, Vienna, 1 Jan 1895, indicates that he died on 30 Dec 1894, age 68, and that he was survived by his wife Johanna, his son Dr. Max Zwillinger, and his daughter-in-law, Frida (Rebenwur
2 CONC zl) Zwillinger.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage record: https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000225494220520
