1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1737
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elijah (Eliezer Hirschel) Apter, died 1737.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of R' Zvi Hirsch, He married his first cousin, daughter of Samuel Katzenellenbogen and Reina.
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel was Parnas of the Posen community
2 CONT
2 CONT Elijah was the progenitor of the Samuel family, which settled in London and Philadelphia (USA).
2 CONT
2 CONT =Source=
2 CONT
2 CONT The Unbroken Chain - Neil Rosenstein (1990) Volume 1, Chapter 11, page 26, G 8.2
