1 NOTE {geni:about_me} According to page 741 of Dr. Neil Rosenstein's book [http://www.geni.com/projects/The-Unbroken-Chain-by-Dr-Neil-Rosenstein/4064 '''"The Unbroken Chain"'''] (2-nd edition, volume 2), it says that G13.1 R' Eleazar La
2 CONC ndau was ''married with no issue''. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The same text was repeated in the 3-rd edition of the book, chapter 10, volume 3, page 754. However, in the new edition the R' Eleazar Landau is marked G14.1 - i.e. 14-th generation instead of 13-th.
2 CONT
2 CONT The book does not say that R' Eleazar Landau lived in Brody - but says that his book ''Zichron Eleazar'' was published in the city and that father of the R' Eleazar was ''of Brody''.
2 CONT
2 CONT Concerning "no issue", see, however, the '''about''' comment to the profile: https://www.geni.com/people/Arye-Leib-Landau/6000000001601066020
