2 CONT Czyżew, Apr 14/26 (Tue) Moszko Joszko (Moses Joseph) Chaimowicz Geloch, local rabbi, came with Gabriel Boruchowicz Szapiro, bachelor, born in Sokółka, 19 yo, son of Boruch and Rasia Mirel (Rachel? Miriam) nee Herszkowicz (ie daugh
2 CONC ter of Hersz/Hirsh) - spouses Shapiro are textile merchants in Szczuczyn, with miss Raszka Lejbkowicz Szwartz (Rachel Schwarz), 16 yo, daughter of Leyb(ko) and Maria Dwejra (Miriam Deborah) nee Rafał (daughter of Raphael? it's jus
2 CONC t a hypothesis because of that crossing-out) - spouses Schwarz are innkeepers/distillers in Czyżew, with their 4 alive parents, with witnesses: Zelek Szmulowicz Stępel/Stempel, a 45 yo furrier, and Aron Wolfowicz Szwartz, a 35 yo 
2 CONC innkeeper/distiller, both Czyżew dwellers, and he (rabbi) stated that Gabriel and Raszka were married today. 3 banns, no prenup etc.
