2 CONC heye) "Boruchowicz" Sapiero, 18, son of Boruch and Rasza Mira (Rachel Miriam) the spouses - merchants of Szczuczyn and maiden Ryfka Laja (Leah) Jelen, 17, daughter of Icek (Isaac) and Perla the spouses, residing in Kaluszyn 3 bann
2 CONC s in both synagogues, no prenup etc.
