1 NAME Judka משה זאב וולף /Goldreich/
2 GIVN Judka משה זאב וולף
2 _MARNM Goldreich
2 NICK Ejgeles - Yehuda Moshe Zeev Wolf
1 NAME יהודה משה זאב וולף /אייגעלעס גאלדרייך/
2 GIVN יהודה משה זאב וולף
2 SURN אייגעלעס גאלדרייך
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1774
1 DEAT
2 DATE 14 APR 1828
2 PLAC House #482
2 ADDR
3 CITY Lublin
3 CTRY Poland
1 OCCU Merchant
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://cemetery.jewish.org.pl/id_127105/info
2 CONT
2 CONT ================================
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Here is his tombstone: http://cemetery.jewish.org.pl/id_89142/photo.jpeg/ Can anybody read it?
2 CONT (Note: This is an old photo or incorrect tombstone)
2 CONT
2 CONT שנת תקפח ל
2 CONT יחרדו הרואים ויזילו דמעות
2 CONT השומעים ממרום שלוחה כעת
2 CONT זאת אצעק כמרה ויו_יך לעפר
2 CONT פנה איש השביע נפש נענה
2 CONT הלך תמים מעודו פנה זיו והוד
2 CONT כאיום קרץ בלא עתו נגדע לאו
2 CONT ההרבנ' הגביר מוהרר יהודה
2 CONT משה זאב וואף זצל במוהרר
2 CONT זכרי מנדיל יצונפ יום ג כ
2 CONT ד
2 CONT (השאר לא קריא)
2 CONT
2 CONT It is worth noting that it says he was buried on a Tuesday, but it follows with a כ this doesn't make much sense if he died 14th April 1828 Julian calendar or Gregorian.
2 CONT Tuesday is a day after the 14th Gregorian. But something doesn't fit with יום ג' כ(ד)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT And here is the entry for him in the Lublin Old Cemetery database http://cemetery.jewish.org.pl/list/c_55/ile_1 lublins 0 78 M : Yehuda Moshe Zeev Volf, son of Zacharia Mendel, zm. w 5588 r.
2 CONT
2 CONT Simon Srebrny writes on 7 June 2015:
2 CONT
2 CONT Death Lublin 1828 №165
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.szukajwarchiwach.gov.pl/skan/-/skan/f286da5e2f0295138d307dc09c8eb8bc53d9c1c104529122710d9f836279346d
2 CONT
2 CONT Natan Morgensztern, kupiec, 42, and Icek Goldreich, kupiec, 31, testified on 15 April 1828 that on 14 April 1828 at House 482 Judka Goldreich died of nervous fever and pneumonia, kupiec, 48, son of Mendel and the late Nisla Goldre
2 CONC ich, widower, leaving behind four sons Icek, Szaul Leyb, Majer Szmul and Nissen, and five daughters Sura Czarne in Lwow, Gitla, Szayndla, Golda and Neytza Goldreich
2 CONT
2 CONT NB: Judka left behind four sons and five daughters when he died in 1828, but Ester Perla left behind three sons and three daughters when she died in 1827.
2 CONT
2 CONT Judka Goldreich: Icek, Szaul Leyb, Majer Szmul and Nissen -- Sura Czarne in Lwow, Gitla, Szayndla, Golda and Neytza Ester Perla: Szaul Leib, Majer and Nissen -- Szayndla, Golda and Neytza.
2 CONT
2 CONT Judka therefore had a first wife, who must have been the mother of Icek, Sura Czarne and Gitla.
