2 CONT Death Warszawa 1868 #133
2 CONT
2 CONT https://metbox3.genealodzy.pl/1/metryka_get.php?op=download&dir=gr9NNB0uFVDYvMw-W234ohhP_YQr00RRi0nHDHzZY10zXaQorXQdwbixsZK84QGa&znak=gZ6VR7ATzLNzjDZ5AD__Tc6baH2OfKVqd4EVZwmYNgo,&plik=130-135.jpg
2 CONT ————————————————
2 CONT After the death of Gitla’s husband Wertenstein her grandfather Mendel Goldrajch gave her his shop in Lublin for three years lending to give her the opportunity to cover her debts.
2 CONT The notary archive of Lublin: 1828 №148
2 CONT
2 CONT https://skanoteka.genealodzy.pl/index.php?op=pg&id=4356&se=&sy=54&kt=&plik=034.jpg&x=1589&y=1468&zoom=1.68
2 CONT
2 CONT ——————————————————————- This is not the Gitla Goldreich who was married to Jankiel Joelowicz Goldhamer. That Gitla was much older. Her father's name may have been Peysach. That Gitla and Jankiel Goldhamer were still married when t
2 CONC heir son Leyzor married in 1844. See http://szukajwarchiwach.pl/35/1753/0/2/55/skan/full/fIGjPOwoGToe4J5aMAfxSg for that record. That fact is incompatible with facts about this Gitla.
2 CONT
2 CONT This Gitla was not the daughter of Pessa, but of Judka Goldreich's first wife, Ruchla Michla Lewi.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gitla was first married to Boruch Wertensztajn. Their son Icek Natan was born in Lublin in 1822.
2 CONT
2 CONT JRI-PL: Jewish Birth Lublin Nr.145/1822: Birth of WERTENSZTAYN Icek Natan to Boruch and Matki Gitli Judkowiczow GOLDREICH; FHL film 995828
