1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Her father's 1828 death record states that she resides in Lwow.
2 CONT
2 CONT First marriage probably took place in 1812 - according to the notary inscription from the same year under №419: her grandmother Nysla [Jsla] Goldrajch gave the evidence as a witness for a reason of her marriage (as she didn’t have
2 CONC  a birth record because Jews weren’t registered before 1810 in Lublin)
2 CONT
2 CONT https://notariaty.genealodzy.pl/index.php?op=pg&id=3977&se=&sy=21&kt=&plik=040.jpg&x=262&y=124&zoom=2.08
2 CONT —————————————————-
2 CONT Here is the record of her marriage to Herz Gross: https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CS9T-L961-N?i=703&cat=1343978
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Nr.28/1828 16 October 1828 House Nr.263 Groom: Herz Gross, Kaufmann, sub Fnr 2408, widower Bride: Sare Czarne Margules, Wahltochter der kinderlosen Eheleute Moses Getzel und Ester Sonter sub Fnr 1517, divorced Witnesses: 
2 CONC Abraham David Korkes, Buchhalter ; Leib Brodwurm Rabbi: Jacob Auerbach
2 CONT
2 CONT Second Marriage Ozarow 1853 №12 page 38
2 CONT https://metryki.genbaza.pl/genbaza,detail,388667,38
