2 CONC z Bernstein of Lwow.[https://www.geni.com/people/R-Jacob-Naftali-Herz-Berenstein-of-Lvov/6000000022410037791]''' (Written by https://www.geni.com/people/R-Markus-Mordechai-Zeev-Braude/6000000003050663528, here: https://www.jewishg
