1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Alter Shevach Taubes was born in Vaslui c. 1880 to Sender and Shprintza. He was a merchant. Prior to WWII he lived in Mosty Wielkie, Poland. During the war he was in Mosty Wielkie, Poland. <br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married twice, to 2 sisters, first to Sheva Shtikler, and after Sheva died, to her sister Tzirel Shtikler. He had a daughter and a son with Sheva. His civil marriage to Tzirel took place in 1916. (Source: Mosty Wielkie yizk
2 CONC or book, page 108, written by his daughter Shprintza Katz)<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Shevach was murdered in 1942 in Mosty Wielkie, Poland. See memorial pages uploaded.
2 CONT
