1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The aqusisition conrtact of the property and grounds in Szczebrzeszyn from the 30th of April 1795. 
2 CONT The land was sold by the local Municipality (The Magistrat of Szczebrzeszyn) as the liquidation of the property public sale of the house of a Polish debtor and the non payed cunstruction site for the Russian (Orthodox) Church.
2 CONT
