2 SURN Rothenburg
2 _MARNM Landau
1 SEX F
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Was not the daughter of any of the Menachem Mendel of Korotschins as per early versions of the tree. Ezekiel Landau is recorded as a brother in law of Avigdor of Chentschin. This was previously understood to mean t
2 CONC hat Ezekiel was the son in law of Avigdor's father i.e. Menachem Mendel. However the correct understanding evident in the book תבנית אות יוסף is that Avigdor married Ezekiel's sister.
2 CONT
2 CONT The only alternative version recorded is that she was called Breindel and was the daughter of Maharam Zusskind of Lublin. This is the current Geni view.
2 CONT
2 CONT ('''NOTE:''' There were three Menachem Mendel of Krotoschins.
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Menachem-Mendel-Auerbach-author-of-Ateret-Zekenim/6000000004210360913
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/R-Menachem-Mendel-Auerbach-the-Younger-A-B-D-Krotoschin/6000000002802422237
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/R-Menachem-Mendel-Margaliyot-A-B-D-Krotoszyn/6000000030693975765
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.geni.com/people/R-Ezekiel-Landau/6000000006929078096 lived between 1687 and 1747. It therefore seems that the correct father in law was https://www.geni.com/people/R-Menachem-Mendel-Margaliyot-A-B-D-Krotoszyn/600000003
2 CONC 0693975765. He was too young to be son in law of https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Menachem-Mendel-Auerbach-author-of-Ateret-Zekenim/6000000004210360913 and too old to be son in law of https://www.geni.com/people/R-Menachem-Mendel
2 CONC -Auerbach-the-Younger-A-B-D-Krotoschin/6000000002802422237. The date of death of https://www.geni.com/people/R-Menachem-Mendel-Margaliyot-A-B-D-Krotoszyn/6000000030693975765 has been taken from his tombstone inscription.)
