2 CONT
2 CONT Was one of the first Jewish inhabitants of Ozorkow where he set up a clothes factory.
2 CONT
2 CONT Was close to Rabbis Fischel of Strikow, Shmuel Abba of Zichlin and Meir Leibush (Malbim).
2 CONT
