2 CONT '''Henryk''' was born in '''Wolczyniec''' (Vovchynets (Ukrainian: Вовчинець, Polish: Wołczyniec), a village in Ivano-Frankivsk, Ukraine (former Stanislawow).  His father '''Marcus Wolf''' was a bank manager in Stanislawow accordin
