2 CONC e from Markus Wolf Aschkenazi (bank manager in Stanisławów), with the death certificate attached. Date of item: 1913 Size: 24 Language: Polish Country: Poland Community: Stanislawow (Ivano-Frankivsk) Origin: GAIFO, f.231, op.1, d.
