1 NOTE {geni:about_me} This is incorrect Isaak Zabludowsky's  first wife was not  a daughter of Jacob Heilprin!  Isaaks first wife was named Pessa , she was a daughter of a Marcus!  Most probably the same  Marcus that is mentioned as Cha
2 CONC im Zabludowsky's father in law!  (Isaaks sister in law's father! ) To save on marriage expenses often  two brothers were married to the to  2 sisters in an other family! The correct information comes from the documents of Isaaks d
2 CONC aughter Fayga Laia 's marriage to Mayer Wolf Cohn  the 29th of December 1829. I have earlier written that Isaak was married to Pessa, but someone erased it!  The information that Isaak Zabludowskys sister was married to a Jacob Ko
2 CONC ppel Heilprins probably comes from the Bialystocker communities Yiskor book in America!  It can also be misunderstood information originate from the fact that Isaaks second wife Hinda was a widow after Chaim Halberstam.  Halbersta
2 CONC m/ Halberstedter/ Halperin /Galperin and Heilprin is the same family!   
2 CONT
2 CONT Many facts  in that book is mixed up information and some is pure guessing!  
2 CONT
2 CONT Nehirah Kadosh  8th of July 2020
