1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He was married before WW11 to Ida (last name not known) 1908-1944. Together they had a daughter, Zelata, born 1933 Vilna Lithuania. Lithuanians near the end of the war killed Ida. Elijah and Zelata survived. Zelata
2 CONC  married David Finger, died 2008. Elijah and Zelata and Rifka met at a refugee displaced persons camp. They married in 1948 and continued to live in Lithuania. Their one and only child Yona was born in 1952 in Vilna Lithuania. In 
2 CONC 1958 they moved to Poland. Then in 1960 they moved to Israel. They lived in Israel for almost 40 years until they both died in January & February 1997. Yona and her husband Yacov and their 2 children, Erez and Aya immigrated to th
2 CONC e U.S in August 1993. Elijah was a school teacher in a private Jewish school.
